{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A visual novel filled with strange, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>alluring characters and a lurking, dark danger.</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/BanishingYou_Steam_Divider_Image4.png?t=1743175951\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a mysterious forest with no idea how you got there \u2014 just a surreal invitation to a masquerade ball and a bad feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigating manipulative meetings and potential romance, you\u2019ll find yourself in a realm where fears take form and emotions have teeth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every choice deepens a bond \u2014\u00a0or drives the world toward its undoing.<br><br>In this story you can choose to love, to trust, to save the world \u2014 or watch it all burn!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/BanishingYou_Steam_Divider1.png?t=1743175951\" /><br><br>Branching choice-driven narrative with 12 different endings <br> <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/BanishingYou_Steam_Divider_Image1.png?t=1743175951\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/BanishingYou_Steam_Divider3.png?t=1743175951\" /><br><br>Personalisation via name and a non-descript, non-gendered player character <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/BanishingYou_Steam_Divider_Image3.png?t=1743175951\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/BanishingYou_Steam_Divider2.png?t=1743175951\" /><br><br>Rich, hand-drawn character illustrations, backgrounds and UI <br> <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/BanishingYou_Steam_Divider_Image2.png?t=1743175951\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/BanishingYou_Steam_Divider4.png?t=1743175951\" /><br><br>5 potential, non-mandatory romances</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You met Ende","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/31c73b122ba003741d7d0608e2a457b9496f65b7.jpg"},{"name":"You met Lesan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/6583343a81ff1865868ded059b8e13efdf0c67bc.jpg"},{"name":"You met Ness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/183770fc1205b5879b4856c47cb2858772c49d1e.jpg"},{"name":"You met Skirun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/96710d25f428f5356d244115e3714ceef42ebc1c.jpg"},{"name":"You met Noht","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/1912c4a8aeeeda8e8433f92e20994b23f1483b43.jpg"},{"name":"You met the Fox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/e06c9aaa6bdacdc6a206449e0530f343316c8ac4.jpg"},{"name":"Sided with Noht","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/6c99c6b3115f912685c24c1ea742f6519579bbab.jpg"},{"name":"Sided with Ende","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/b28ea26b57894a6217f3e97575f44570f08e8642.jpg"},{"name":"You met the Bunny","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/fa1b4823de8f3f4d8eb350eea18c0e229b8a5418.jpg"},{"name":"You talked to Ende in the Garden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/f61960c3371bba